oduced without","words":[["and",259.46,260.32],["so",260.32,260.56],["we",260.56,260.72],["have",260.72,260.86],["a",260.86,260.96],["wide",260.96,261.22],["range",261.22,261.52],["of",261.52,261.68],["food",261.68,262.02],["organic",262.02,263.16],["means",263.16,263.74],["it's",263.74,264.08],["all",264.08,264.28],["produced",264.28,264.66],["without",264.66,265.2]]},{"start":265.2,"end":271.84,"text":"the use of artificial fertilizers or pesticides I see that sounds good could","words":[["the",265.2,265.46],["use",265.46,265.7],["of",265.7,265.82],["artificial",265.82,266.3],["fertilizers",266.3,267.2],["or",267.2,267.6],["pesticides",267.6,268.02],["I",268.02,269.02],["see",269.02,269.38],["that",269.38,269.84],["sounds",269.84,270.18],["good",270.18,270.6],["could",270.6,271.84]]},{"start":272.46,"end":276.74,"text":"you tell me what sort of recreational activities are available either at the","words":[["you",272.46,272.8],["tell",272.8,273.0],["me",273.0,273.12],["what",273.12,273.28],["sort",273.28,273.58],["of",273.58,273.82],["recreational",273.82,274.28],["activities",274.28,275.16],["are",275.16,275.44],["available",275.44,275.8],["either",275.8,276.32],["at",276.32,276.6],["the",276.6,276.74]]},{"start":276.74,"end":283.12,"text":"center or in the area yes here at the center we offer farm tours they're very","words":[["center",276.74,277.0],["or",277.0,277.38],["in",277.38,277.66],["the",277.66,277.76],["area",277.76,278.04],["yes",278.04,278.78],["here",278.78,279.9],["at",279.9,280.06],["the",280.06,280.14],["center",280.14,280.48],["we",280.48,280.84],["offer",280.84,281.12],["farm",281.12,281.68],["tours",281.68,282.14],["they're",282.14,282.76],["very",282.76,283.12]]},{"start":283.12,"end":287.84,"text":"popular, one of the farm managers shows people around and explains some of the","words":[["popular,",283.12,283.58],["one",284.2,284.46],["of",284.46,284.58],["the",284.58,284.7],["farm",284.7,284.96],["managers",284.96,285.36],["shows",285.36,285.