",367.59,367.77],["groups",367.77,368.09],["of",368.09,368.31],["five",368.31,368.63],["or",368.63,368.91],["more",368.91,369.29]]},{"start":369.29,"end":375.07,"text":"and they've got to be acquaintances, they have to cooperate closely. These courses","words":[["and",369.29,370.15],["they've",370.15,370.41],["got",370.41,370.51],["to",370.51,370.63],["be",370.63,370.73],["acquaintances,",370.73,371.37],["they",371.75,372.13],["have",372.13,372.29],["to",372.29,372.45],["cooperate",372.45,372.93],["closely.",372.93,373.67],["These",374.45,374.73],["courses",374.73,375.07]]},{"start":375.07,"end":379.97,"text":"are very popular, especially with school groups, but adults seem to enjoy them too.","words":[["are",375.07,375.35],["very",375.35,375.61],["popular,",375.61,376.15],["especially",376.25,376.63],["with",376.63,376.87],["school",376.87,377.27],["groups,",377.27,377.71],["but",378.01,378.37],["adults",378.37,378.73],["seem",378.73,379.07],["to",379.07,379.21],["enjoy",379.21,379.51],["them",379.51,379.67],["too.",379.67,379.97]]},{"start":380.57,"end":387.39,"text":"What do they involve? The things like map reading? Well, not exactly. What it is,","words":[["What",380.57,380.95],["do",380.95,381.11],["they",381.11,381.29],["involve?",381.29,381.71],["The",382.13,382.13],["things",382.13,382.57],["like",382.57,382.77],["map",382.77,383.07],["reading?",383.07,383.31],["Well,",383.95,384.43],["not",384.75,385.33],["exactly.",385.33,385.89],["What",386.69,386.99],["it",386.99,387.13],["is,",387.13,387.39]]},{"start":387.75,"end":392.49,"text":"we've got a large area of woodland on the farm and we run this course there.","words":[["we've",387.75,388.09],["got",388.09,388.25],["a",388.25,388.47],["large",388.47,388.81],["area",388.81,389.31],["of",389.31,389.53],["woodland",389.53,389.93],["on",389.93,390.17],["the",390.17,390.29],["farm",390.29,390.61],["and",390.61,391.27],["we",391.27,391.45],["run",391.45,391.59],["this",391.59,391.79],["course",391.79,392.05],["t