",481.33,482.17],["about",482.17,482.57],["seven",482.57,483.11],["pounds",483.11,483.53],["for",483.53,483.95]]},{"start":483.95,"end":489.19,"text":"cooked meals depending on the menu you want. Use of the kitchen facilities is","words":[["cooked",483.95,484.27],["meals",484.27,484.69],["depending",484.69,485.41],["on",485.41,485.77],["the",485.77,485.87],["menu",485.87,486.17],["you",486.17,486.41],["want.",486.41,486.73],["Use",487.19,487.75],["of",487.75,487.97],["the",487.97,488.07],["kitchen",488.07,488.27],["facilities",488.27,488.85],["is",488.85,489.19]]},{"start":489.19,"end":494.59,"text":"extra as is the higher of the meeting room. It depends really what exactly you","words":[["extra",489.19,489.85],["as",489.85,490.47],["is",490.47,490.61],["the",490.61,490.75],["higher",490.75,490.97],["of",490.97,491.19],["the",491.19,491.29],["meeting",491.29,491.49],["room.",491.49,491.81],["It",492.47,492.77],["depends",492.77,493.15],["really",493.15,493.53],["what",493.53,493.95],["exactly",493.95,494.33],["you",494.33,494.59]]},{"start":494.59,"end":499.97,"text":"want and for how many people. Right well I've made a note of all that and I'll","words":[["want",494.59,494.99],["and",494.99,495.33],["for",495.33,495.61],["how",495.61,495.75],["many",495.75,495.91],["people.",495.91,496.33],["Right",496.91,497.29],["well",497.29,497.85],["I've",497.85,498.33],["made",498.33,498.47],["a",498.47,498.59],["note",498.59,498.81],["of",498.81,498.95],["all",498.95,499.15],["that",499.15,499.43],["and",499.43,499.75],["I'll",499.75,499.97]]},{"start":499.97,"end":503.53,"text":"discuss it with the rest of the group. Then I'll get back to you with a firm","words":[["discuss",499.97,500.27],["it",500.27,500.49],["with",500.49,500.61],["the",500.61,500.73],["rest",500.73,500.87],["of",500.87,501.03],["the",501.03,501.13],["group.",501.13,501.39],["Then",501.95,502.39],["I'll",502.39,502.53],["get",502.53,502.63],["back",502.63,502.85],["to",502.85,503.01],["you",503.01,503.11],["with",503.11,503.23],["a",503.23,503.35],["firm",503.35,503.53]]},{"start":503.53,"end":508.73,"text":"booking can I do that by phone yes you can but once you've made a booking we","words":[["booking",503.53,503.83],["can",503.83,504.85],["I",504.85,504.93],["do",504.93,505.03],["that",505.03,505.13],["by",505.13,505.25],["phone",505.25,505.51],["yes",505.51,506.17],["you",506.17,506.43],["can",506.43,506.71],["but",506.71,507.31],["once",507.31,507.61],["you've",507.61,507.83],["made",507.83,508.01],["a",508.01,508.17],["booking",508.17,508.43],["we",508.43,508.73]]},{"start":508.73,"end":513.71,"text":"would need a deposit within five days to secure it then you just pay the balance","words":[["would",508.73,508.91],["need",508.91,509.11],["a",509.11,509.29],["deposit",509.29,509.67],["within",509.67,510.15],["five",510.15,510.57],["days",510.57,511.01],["to",511.01,511.25],["secure",511.25,511.61],["it",511.61,511.89],["then",511.89,512.59],["you",512.59,512.77],["just",512.77,512.99],["pay",512.99,513.29],["the",513.29,513.41],["balance",513.41,513.71]]},{"start":513.71,"end":520.57,"text":"when you're here oh yes of course could you give me the address please yes it's","words":[["when",513.71,513.93],["you're",513.93,514.15],["here",514.15,514.35],["oh",514.35,514.77],["yes",514.77,515.21],["of",515.21,515.51],["course",515.51,515.73],["could",515.73,516.89],["you",516.89,517.09],["give",517.09,517.37],["me",517.37,517.69],["the",517.69,518.33],["address",518.33,518.75],["please",518.75,519.11],["yes",519.11,519.75],["it's",519.75,520.57]]},{"start":520.57,"end":538.23,"text":"It's Winsham Farm, Cateal Road, that's C-O-T-E-H-E-L-E, near Sherbourne, and the postcode is S-H-12-1-L-Q.","words":[["It's",520.57,520.81],["Winsham",520.81,521.51],["Farm,",521.51,522.11],["Cateal",523.25,523.93],["Road,",523.93,524.47],["that's",525.47,526.13],["C",526.13,526.77],["-O",526.77,527.23],["-T",527.23,527.75],["-E",527.75,528.69],["-H",528.69,529.49],["-E",529.49,529.95]